      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Annan Perumal\nThayaar: Alarmelmangai Thayaar\nVimanam: Tatvatyodaka Vimanam\nPushkarani: Tiruvellakkulam/Shweta Pushkarani\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located 11 km from Sirkazhi\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nTirumangai Azhwar: 10 Pasurams\n",
